From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jrash <johnrash@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 18:06:47 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 277/342] dwc2: wait for a channel to really halt

_HaltChannel() waited once on the lane's condition variable, which
SubmitTransfer() also notifies when a transfer is queued on the bulk lane. With
two busy devices the wait often ended before the channel had halted. The caller
then reported no response, and the next transfer reprogrammed a running channel:
with a Wi-Fi download and a USB stick together, all bulk transfers failed from
then on, until a reboot. It now waits until the channel has halted, for at most
100 ms as before. A channel that has just halted by itself isn't enabled again.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/add-ons/kernel/busses/usb/dwc2.cpp | 26 ++++++++++++++++++++++----
 1 file changed, 22 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/add-ons/kernel/busses/usb/dwc2.cpp b/src/add-ons/kernel/busses/usb/dwc2.cpp
index 5fbad9f0e2..0f6e2c51b3 100644
--- a/src/add-ons/kernel/busses/usb/dwc2.cpp
+++ b/src/add-ons/kernel/busses/usb/dwc2.cpp
@@ -1421,10 +1421,28 @@ DWC2::_ShouldYield(dwc2_lane* lane, uint32 packets)
 void
 DWC2::_HaltChannel(dwc2_lane* lane)
 {
-	ConditionVariableEntry entry;
-	lane->halted.Add(&entry);
-	_Write(HC_CHAR(lane->channel), _Read(HC_CHAR(lane->channel)) | HCCHAR_CHDIS | HCCHAR_CHENA);
-	entry.Wait(B_RELATIVE_TIMEOUT, 100000);
+	// (a channel that has just halted by itself isn't enabled again)
+	uint32 character = _Read(HC_CHAR(lane->channel));
+	if ((character & HCCHAR_CHENA) != 0) {
+		_Write(HC_CHAR(lane->channel),
+			character | HCCHAR_CHDIS | HCCHAR_CHENA);
+	}
+
+	// The lane's condition variable also tells of new transfers on the lane,
+	// so it doesn't by itself mean that the channel has halted. Taking it for
+	// that, the next transfer reprogrammed a running channel, and all that
+	// followed on the bulk lane failed.
+	bigtime_t deadline = system_time() + 100000;
+	while ((atomic_get(&lane->status) & HCINT_CHHLTD) == 0) {
+		ConditionVariableEntry entry;
+		lane->halted.Add(&entry);
+		if ((atomic_get(&lane->status) & HCINT_CHHLTD) != 0)
+			break;
+		bigtime_t remaining = deadline - system_time();
+		if (remaining <= 0)
+			break;
+		entry.Wait(B_RELATIVE_TIMEOUT, remaining);
+	}
 }
 
 
